From 66edac23de2b78b3269caaf41ec043f438b6e867 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Martins <372861+edulmartins@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 16:50:37 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PCI: pwrctrl: apple-wifi: Match the BCM4357

The d221 (iPhone X) BCM4357 powers with the same REG_ON and 100 ms
stabilization as the j172 BCM4355, so map its PCI ID to that data. This
lets the endpoint node claim pci14e4,440a and still bind pci-pwrctrl.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ...pwrctrl-apple-wifi-Match-the-BCM4357.patch | 29 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 29 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 kernel/patches/drivers/pci/0030-PCI-pwrctrl-apple-wifi-Match-the-BCM4357.patch

diff --git a/kernel/patches/drivers/pci/0030-PCI-pwrctrl-apple-wifi-Match-the-BCM4357.patch b/kernel/patches/drivers/pci/0030-PCI-pwrctrl-apple-wifi-Match-the-BCM4357.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1d5a408
--- /dev/null
+++ b/kernel/patches/drivers/pci/0030-PCI-pwrctrl-apple-wifi-Match-the-BCM4357.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Eduardo Martins <372861+edulmartins@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 15:30:00 -0600
+Subject: [PATCH] PCI: pwrctrl: apple-wifi: Match the BCM4357
+
+The d221 (iPhone X) BCM4357 powers with the same REG_ON and 100 ms
+stabilization as the j172 BCM4355, so map its PCI ID to that data. This
+lets the endpoint node claim pci14e4,440a and still bind pci-pwrctrl.
+
+Signed-off-by: Eduardo Martins <372861+edulmartins@users.noreply.github.com>
+---
+ drivers/pci/pwrctrl/pci-pwrctrl-apple-wifi.c | 4 ++++
+ 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)
+
+diff --git a/drivers/pci/pwrctrl/pci-pwrctrl-apple-wifi.c b/drivers/pci/pwrctrl/pci-pwrctrl-apple-wifi.c
+index b78f290..cf90165 100644
+--- a/drivers/pci/pwrctrl/pci-pwrctrl-apple-wifi.c
++++ b/drivers/pci/pwrctrl/pci-pwrctrl-apple-wifi.c
+@@ -230,6 +230,10 @@ static const struct of_device_id apple_wifi_pwrctrl_of_match[] = {
+ 		.compatible = "pci14e4,43dc",
+ 		.data = &apple_j172_wifi_data,
+ 	},
++	{
++		.compatible = "pci14e4,440a",
++		.data = &apple_j172_wifi_data,
++	},
+ 	{ }
+ };
+ MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, apple_wifi_pwrctrl_of_match);
